     9→description: >
    10→  Web-based interface for viewing, editing, and managing kspec state. Includes three deployment
    11→  modes:
    12→
    13→  1. Local daemon mode - Elysia.js server on Bun with WebSocket for real-time updates
    14→
    15→  2. Web dashboard - SvelteKit + shadcn-svelte for full CRUD operations
    16→
    17→  3. GitHub Pages export - Static JSON snapshot with read-only SPA for public sharing
    18→
    19→
    20→  Tech stack: Elysia.js, Bun runtime, WebSocket (not SSE), SvelteKit, shadcn-svelte.
    21→
    22→  Distribution via bun build --compile for portable executables.
