   139→    description: |
   140→      REST API contract for HTTP endpoints and WebSocket protocol for real-time communication.
   141→      All REST endpoints return JSON with consistent patterns. WebSocket uses topic-based pub/sub
   142→      with request_id correlation for command acknowledgment.
