   154→    notes: []
   155→    created: 2026-01-22T07:00:00.000Z
   156→    acceptance_criteria:
   157→      - id: ac-1
   158→        given: daemon running on localhost:3456
   159→        when: request from localhost:5173 (dev server) received
   160→        then: CORS headers allow the request
   161→      - id: ac-2
   162→        given: daemon is running
   163→        when: GET /api/tasks is called
   164→        then: returns JSON array of all tasks with status, priority, spec_ref, notes count
   165→      - id: ac-3
   166→        given: daemon is running
   167→        when: GET /api/tasks with status filter (e.g., ?status=pending&status=in_progress)
   168→        then: returns only tasks matching filter (supports multi-value)
   169→      - id: ac-4
   170→        given: daemon is running
   171→        when: GET /api/tasks with pagination (?limit=10&offset=20)
   172→        then: returns paginated results with {items, total, offset, limit} wrapper
   173→      - id: ac-5
   174→        given: daemon is running
   175→        when: GET /api/tasks/:ref is called
   176→        then: resolves ref via ReferenceIndex, returns full task with notes, todos, dependencies
   177→      - id: ac-6
   178→        given: daemon is running
   179→        when: POST /api/tasks/:ref/start is called
   180→        then: task transitions to in_progress, WebSocket broadcasts update, returns updated task
   181→      - id: ac-7
   182→        given: daemon is running
   183→        when: POST /api/tasks/:ref/note with {content} body
   184→        then: note appended to task, shadow commit occurs, WebSocket broadcasts update
   185→      - id: ac-8
   186→        given: daemon is running
   187→        when: GET /api/items is called
   188→        then: returns JSON array of all spec items (modules, features, requirements)
   189→      - id: ac-9
   190→        given: daemon is running
   191→        when: GET /api/items with type filter (?type=feature&type=requirement)
   192→        then: returns only items matching type filter
   193→      - id: ac-10
   194→        given: daemon is running
   195→        when: GET /api/items/:ref is called
   196→        then: resolves ref, returns full item with acceptance_criteria, traits, relationships
   197→      - id: ac-11
   198→        given: daemon is running
   199→        when: GET /api/items/:ref/tasks is called
   200→        then: returns tasks linked to this spec via AlignmentIndex
   201→      - id: ac-12
   202→        given: daemon is running
   203→        when: GET /api/inbox is called
   204→        then: returns all inbox items ordered by created_at desc
   205→      - id: ac-13
   206→        given: daemon is running
   207→        when: POST /api/inbox with {text} body
