   209→      - id: ac-14
   210→        given: daemon is running
   211→        when: DELETE /api/inbox/:ref is called
   212→        then: removes inbox item, returns success confirmation
   213→      - id: ac-15
   214→        given: daemon is running
   215→        when: GET /api/meta/session is called
   216→        then: returns current session context (focus, threads, questions)
   217→      - id: ac-16
   218→        given: daemon is running
   219→        when: GET /api/meta/agents is called
