   229→      - id: ac-19
   230→        given: daemon is running
   231→        when: GET /api/search?q=login is called
   232→        then: searches across all items using grep/title matching
   233→      - id: ac-20
   234→        given: daemon is running
   235→        when: GET /api/validate is called
   236→        then: runs full validation, returns ValidationResult
   237→      - id: ac-21
   238→        given: daemon is running
   239→        when: GET /api/alignment is called
   240→        then: returns AlignmentIndex stats and warnings
   241→      - id: ac-22
   242→        given: API request has invalid ref
   243→        when: any endpoint with :ref parameter
   244→        then: returns {error, message, suggestion} with 404 status, suggests similar refs if available
   245→      - id: ac-23
   246→        given: API request has validation error
   247→        when: POST/PUT with invalid body
   248→        then: returns {error, details:[{field, message}]} with 400 status
   249→      - id: ac-24
   250→        given: API request causes state transition error
