   298→    description: |
   299→      SvelteKit-based web interface for viewing and editing specs, tasks, inbox, and session state.
   300→      Uses shadcn-svelte components for accessible UI. Connects to daemon via REST API and WebSocket
   301→      for real-time updates. Includes WebSocketManager for connection resilience with exponential
   302→      backoff reconnection and sequence deduplication.
