   456→    description: >
   457→      Static site generation from kspec state for hosting read-only views on GitHub Pages.
   458→
   459→      CI workflow builds JSON snapshot from shadow branch on push, SPA reads this JSON for
   460→      rendering.
   461→
   462→      Enables deep linking to tasks/specs from PRs and issues with data freshness indicator.
